# ChkTeX resource file for this paper.
#
# LaTeX Workshop auto-loads this file (it appends `-l <this-dir>/.chktexrc` when
# linting the root file), and command-line `chktex` reads it from the project
# root too -- so the suppression below applies no matter which folder is opened
# as the VS Code workspace root.
#
# We keep every \label on its own line, immediately after its \section /
# \subsection / \caption -- a deliberate, consistent style in this draft. ChkTeX
# reads that line break as a "space before \label" and raises Warning 24
# ("Delete this space to maintain correct page references") on every section.
# It is a false positive for this style, so disable it globally for the paper.
CmdLine
{
    -n24
}
